ps://si.imgix.net/74f8e233/uploads/origins/86816ddf-31b9-4a33-b3cb-de4bb0c9ad3d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e70b38c1edd53384718448ff774bd10b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/74f8e233/uploads/origins/86816ddf-31b9-4a33-b3cb-de4bb0c9ad3d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d3eb71bce9ffece2161f7b9d69126d9f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I truly love your art works and I'm also a big fan of Mahou shoujo madoka!\nMay I request a witch logo for my original character?\nSimilar to this:\nhttps://skeb.jp/@Harumayago/works/55\n\nIf it is not possible, then you may choose to draw my character, I would love to see her in your art style too!\nShe is a Shadow Kitsune Demon. She is the Deity of the Ancient Shadows.\nShe is a dancer and secretly an assassin. She is from a royal bloodline. She manipulates shadows and fire.\nHer story is similar to Homura where she loses her smile after a long while and becomes the villain.\n\nThe pose and expression is up to you if you choose to draw my character too!\nIf it's okay, please draw this on a 16:9 ratio in a vertical/ portrait way.\nI would like to ask permission to use this on SNS like Twitter, Twitch & YouTube. Is it also possible to receive a PSD with the background, character and signature separated?\n\nThank you for your consideration! I look forward to what you will create!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1vFS1RB1GZPwNxRHa9u873f5BWb7Kpwse?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}